{"1803840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucky's Tale", "steam_appid": 1803840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/15b83b947482cf31a46b6b18f452dfd6.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Swiftail is a brave fox on a quest to save his best friend Piggy from the monstrously tentacled Glorp. Together, you'll run, jump, and climb your way through a bright, colorful world full of charming characters, boss battles, hundreds of secrets to discover, and exciting 3D platforming action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/761122c476629653a8f4d3983dade00d.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lucky’s Tale</i> broke ground as one of the first 3rd person perspective games in virtual reality, showing the world VR can be much more than 1st person experiences. Its pioneering approach to camera, character motion, environment, and gameplay provide a thrilling experience that allows players to freely roam immersive environments that are at once both toy-like and vast in scale. You'll feel as though you've gone inside the world of a nostalgic platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a hero and save the day in the groundbreaking game that launched a beloved franchise, now remastered for modern VR headsets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/c39aa67f3902887814ec3ad99283b9b5.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW in this version</strong>: remastered lighting, audio, rendering; optimizations for modern HMDs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW in this version</strong>: refined player movement and an updated character model for Lucky (as seen in <i>New Super Lucky's Tale</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels featuring lush swamps, underwater ruins, an active volcano, secret foxholes, boss fights, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person perspective camera built for virtual reality and designed for thrilling yet comfortable platforming action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headset tracking for aiming, throwing, finding hidden items; touch controls for interacting with Lucky and menus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional timed-based and collectathon challenges that reward replays </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, cuddly, and made for all ages and skill levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/15b83b947482cf31a46b6b18f452dfd6.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Swiftail is a brave fox on a quest to save his best friend Piggy from the monstrously tentacled Glorp. Together, you'll run, jump, and climb your way through a bright, colorful world full of charming characters, boss battles, hundreds of secrets to discover, and exciting 3D platforming action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/6905bf675235232642901d2556e1e746.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/761122c476629653a8f4d3983dade00d.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lucky’s Tale</i> broke ground as one of the first 3rd person perspective games in virtual reality, showing the world VR can be much more than 1st person experiences. Its pioneering approach to camera, character motion, environment, and gameplay provide a thrilling experience that allows players to freely roam immersive environments that are at once both toy-like and vast in scale. You'll feel as though you've gone inside the world of a nostalgic platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/47f92661499349472aa1142b323931c5.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a hero and save the day in the groundbreaking game that launched a beloved franchise, now remastered for modern VR headsets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/c39aa67f3902887814ec3ad99283b9b5.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW in this version</strong>: remastered lighting, audio, rendering; optimizations for modern HMDs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW in this version</strong>: refined player movement and an updated character model for Lucky (as seen in <i>New Super Lucky's Tale</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels featuring lush swamps, underwater ruins, an active volcano, secret foxholes, boss fights, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person perspective camera built for virtual reality and designed for thrilling yet comfortable platforming action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headset tracking for aiming, throwing, finding hidden items; touch controls for interacting with Lucky and menus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional timed-based and collectathon challenges that reward replays </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, cuddly, and made for all ages and skill levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.poster.avif?t=1730232875\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.webm?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/extras/f43997a69f6547ac7498f47137845f1a.mp4?t=1730232875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Virtual reality’s original mascot is back! Lucky Swiftail is a brave fox on a quest to save his best friend Piggy from the monstrously tentacled Glorp. Become a hero and save the day in the groundbreaking game that launched a beloved franchise, now remastered for modern VR headsets!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Lucky's Tale looks great and plays even better in this well-deserved remaster.”<br>8/10 – Gaming Nexus<br><br>“Lucky’s Tale is very, very easy to recommend for fans of the genre.”<br>8/10 – 6DOF<br><br>“I love Lucky’s Tale, a wonderful platformer that harks back to the good old days of cartoon platformer antics.”<br>9/10 – Finger Guns<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/header.jpg?t=1730232875", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730232875", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730232875", "website": "https://playfulstudios.com/luckys-tale", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3550 / AMD FX 8150<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 780 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>